  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The speed of the train, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mtext>T</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mtext>20 m s</mtext><mn>-1</mn></msup></math><br /><br />The speed of sound in air, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mtext>330 m s</mtext><mn>-1</mn></msup></math><br /><br />The frequency of the echo detected by the driver of the train is<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>'</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>'</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>930</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>330</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>330</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>930</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>350</mn><mn>310</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>'</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1050</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math></p>",
